{"speciesId":200,"names":{"fr":"Feuforêve","es":"Misdreavus","en":"Misdreavus","ja":"ムウマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It likes playing mischievous tricks such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It loves to bite and yank people's hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It loves to watch people it's scar­ ed. It frightens them by screaming loudly or appear­ ing suddenly."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MISDREAVUS frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. The POKéMON apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fearful feelings of foes and turn them into nutrition."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MISDREAVUS frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. The POKéMON apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fearful feelings of foes and turn them into nutrition."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A MISDREAVUS frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. It apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fear of foes as its nutrition."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It loves to bite and yank people’s hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It likes playing mischievous tricks such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It loves to sneak up on people late at night, then startle them with its shrieklike cry."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It gets nourishment from fear that it absorbs into its red orbs. In daytime, it sleeps in darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It likes playing mischievous tricks, such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It loves to bite and yank people’s hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il fait peur aux aventuriers en pleine nuit et se nourrit de leur frayeur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il fait peur aux aventuriers en pleine nuit et se nourrit de leur frayeur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se nourrit de la peur absorbée par ses orbes rouges. Il somnole à l’ombre en journée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se deleita con el miedo, que absorbe con sus esferas rojas. Por el día, duerme en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It gets nourishment from fear that it absorbs into its red orbs. In daytime, it sleeps in darkness."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"怖がる 心を 赤い 玉で 吸収して 栄養にする。 昼間は 暗がりで 眠っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il pousse des hurlements la nuit pour effrayer les gens."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le gusta hacer travesuras, como gritar y aullar por la noche, para asustar a la gente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It likes playing mischievous tricks, such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"夜中に 人の 泣き叫ぶような 鳴き声を 出して みんなを 驚かせる いたずら好き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feuforêve effraie les gens en poussant un cri à faire froid dans le dos, une sorte de lamentation. Ce Pokémon utilise ses sphères rouges pour absorber les sentiments de terreur de ses ennemis et s’en nourrir."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Misdreavus asusta a la gente con un chillido escalofriante y sollozante. Y, al parecer, usa las esferas rojas para absorber los sentimientos de miedo de los enemigos y usarlos como alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Misdreavus frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. The Pokémon apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fearful feelings of foes and turn them into nutrition."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"すすり泣く ような 鳴き声で 怖がらせる。 相手の 怖がる 心を 赤い 玉で 吸収して 栄養に している らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Feuforêve effraie les gens en poussant un cri à faire froid dans le dos, une sorte de lamentation. Ce Pokémon utilise ses sphères rouges pour absorber les sentiments de terreur de ses ennemis et s’en nourrir."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Misdreavus asusta a la gente con un chillido escalofriante y sollozante. Y, al parecer, usa las esferas rojas para absorber los sentimientos de miedo de los enemigos y usarlos como alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Misdreavus frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. The Pokémon apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fearful feelings of foes and turn them into nutrition."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"すすり泣く ような 鳴き声で 怖がらせる。 相手の 怖がる 心を 赤い 玉で 吸収して 栄養に している らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il ne recule devant rien pour effrayer les humains et leur voler leur énergie vitale. Pour cela, il s’entraîne régulièrement à faire peur."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Atemoriza a la gente de distintas formas y absorbe su energía vital. Entrena todos los días para no perder su toque terrorífico."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It will use any means necessary to frighten people and absorb their life energy. It practices constantly to hone its skill in causing fear."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"あの手 この手で 人を 驚かし 生命エネルギーを 吸い取る。 驚かす 練習は 欠かさない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Si vous entendez des pleurs provenant d’une pièce vide, c’est sûrement un Feuforêve qui vous fait une farce."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Si se escucha un sollozo proveniente de una habitación que en teoría está vacía, es probable que sea Misdreavus haciendo de las suyas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"If you hear a sobbing sound emanating from a vacant room, it’s undoubtedly a bit of mischief from Misdreavus."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"誰もいない 部屋から すすり泣く ような 声が 聞こえたら それは ムウマの イタズラに 違いない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Effrayer les gens est sa raison d’être. Si l’on presse l’oreille contre les sphères rouges de son cou, on peut entendre des gémissements."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Vive para asustar a la gente. Al acercar la oreja a las perlas rojas de su cuello, pueden oírse sollozos de angustia en su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"What gives meaning to its life is surprising others. If you set your ear against the red orbs around its neck, you can hear shrieking."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"驚かせることが 生きがい。 首の 赤い玉に 耳を あてると 中から 悲鳴が 聞こえてくるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il adore faire peur aux humains en imitant leurs pleurs, et n’apprécie guère ceux qui ne se laissent pas intimider."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Disfruta imitando llantos humanos para asustar a la gente. Los valientes no le caen demasiado bien."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"What makes it happy is imitating the voices of weeping people and scaring everyone. It doesn’t deal well with folks who aren’t easily frightened."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"人が 泣き叫ぶ 声を 真似て みんなを おびえさせ 喜ぶ。 肝が 据わった 相手は 苦手。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"It conceals itself in darkness, sending chills up travelers' spines with its childlike weeping. As it observes the frightened travelers with glee, the red orbs upon its chest let off an eerie light."}],"varieties":[{"id":200,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[3,"level-up",27],[4,"level-up",27],[5,"level-up",30],[6,"level-up",30],[7,"level-up",30],[8,"level-up",23],[9,"level-up",23],[10,"level-up",23],[11,"level-up",28],[12,"level-up",30],[13,"level-up",30],[14,"level-up",28],[15,"level-up",28],[16,"level-up",28],[17,"level-up",28],[18,"level-up",28],[23,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[4,"tutor",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],